loss":"many"},{"surface":"வரி","parts":[{"text":"வரி","lemma":"வரி","gloss":"stripes"}],"gloss":"stripes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பாம்பு","parts":[{"text":"பாம்பு","lemma":"பாம்பு","gloss":"snake"}],"gloss":"snake"},{"surface":"பை","parts":[{"text":"பை","lemma":"பை","gloss":"hood"}],"gloss":"hood"},{"surface":"அவிழ்ந்தது","parts":[{"text":"அவிழ்","lemma":"அவிழ்","gloss":"open"},{"text":"ந்தது","lemma":"து","gloss":"it (past neuter singular suffix)"}],"gloss":"opened"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"கூம்பி","parts":[{"text":"கூம்பு","lemma":"கூம்பு","gloss":"close"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having (verbal participle suffix)"}],"gloss":"having closed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொண்டலிற்","parts":[{"text":"கொண்டலிற்","lemma":"கொண்டலிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றொலைந்த","parts":[{"text":"றொலைந்த","lemma":"றொலைந்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வொண்செங்","parts":[{"text":"வொண்செங்","lemma":"வொண்செங்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காந்தள்","parts":[{"text":"காந்தள்","lemma":"காந்தள்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கன்மிசைக்","parts":[{"text":"கன்மிசைக்","lemma":"கன்மிசைக்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கவியு","parts":[{"text":"கவியு","lemma":"கவியு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாடற்கென்","parts":[{"text":"நாடற்கென்","lemma":"நாடற்கென்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"நன்மா","parts":[{"text":"நன்மா","lemma":"நன்மா","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மேனி","parts":[{"text":"மேனி","lemma":"மேனி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யழிபடர்","parts":[{"text":"யழிபடர்","lemma":"யழிபடர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நிலையே","parts":[{"text":"நிலையே","lemma":"நிலையே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Forehead pallor having spread, beauty spots having faded, / long soft bamboo-like shoulders having wasted, bangles having slipped, / \"becoming such a woman is because of you,\" thus / if said, what will be, O friend? Many-striped / snake's hood opened like, having closed, / by the east wind ruined, bright red Kanthal flower / upon the rock drooping, to the lord of the land, my / beautiful dark complexion's ruined state of grief.","translation":"O friend, what would happen if we told the lord of the land—where the bright red kāntal flowers, ruined by the east wind, close up like the opening hood of a many-striped snake and droop upon the rocks—that my beautiful dark complexion is ruined by this state of deep grief, my forehead is covered in pallor, my beauty spots have faded, my long, soft, bamboo-like shoulders have wasted, and my bangles have slipped off, and that all this is because of him?","modern":"தோழியே! நெற்றியில் பசலை படர்ந்து, தேமல் வாடி, நீண்ட மென்மையான மூங்கில் போன்ற தோள்கள் மெலிந்து, வளையல்கள் கழன்று, 'இவள் இப்படி ஆவதற்கு நீங்களே காரணம்' என்று சொன்னால் என்ன ஆகும்? பல வரிகளையுடைய பாம்பின் படம் விரிந்தது போலக் கூம்பி, கொண்டல் காற்றினால் வாடிய ஒளிரும் செங்காந்தள் மலர்கள் மலையின் மேல் கவிழ்ந்து கிடக்கும் நாட்டை உடைய தலைவனுக்கு, எனது அழகிய மாமை நிறம் கொண்ட உடம்பு அழியும் துன்ப நிலையைச் சொன்னால் என்ன?","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine talking to her close friend. She is suffering deeply from the pain of separation from her lover, who is the lord of the mountain country. Her physical state has deteriorated: her forehead has turned pale, her beauty spots have faded, her shoulders have grown thin, and her bangles are slipping off. She asks her friend what would happen if they directly told the hero that he is the cause of her suffering. The poem uses a vivid image of the mountain landscape (Kuriñci tiṇai): the bright red kāntal flowers, battered by the cold east wind, close up and droop over the rocks, resembling the folded hood of a striped snake. This image mirrors the heroine's own state, as she is withered and drooping under the cold wind of separation from her lord.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}